OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AAnthropic to raise $64bn in major stock
OL,4,Amarket listing
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnthropic is floating at a volatile
OL,7,Ftime for AI businesses - following last
OL,8,Fweek's US midterm elections, the Nasdaq
OL,9,Ffell sharply on concerns a Democrat-led
OL,10,FCongress could slow development of the
OL,11,Ftechnology and the buildout of
OL,12,Finfrastructure such as data centres.
OL,14,FThere are also wider fears over the
OL,15,Fbillions of dollars being spent on AI
OL,16,Fand whether it will pay off.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
